          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "CHIPPERFIELD           \tTOWER HILL TL 00 SW  \t\t\t\t\t(West side)                                       6/99                                    \tBarn at Braziers Farm - GV                                     \t\tII Barn. Late C16/early C17, N part much repaired. Timber frame on tarred brick sill,  dark weatherboarded with steep old red tile roof and pantiled S lean-to to LH and RH of gabled porch in 2nd bay from W. Double doors with winnowing door to rear (N) in same bay. Jowled posts with deep straight braces to tie-beams and wallplates. Clasped purlin roof with collar trusses, one purlin, and queen-struts in gable trusses. Slender roof scantling as if for thatch. Listing NGR: TL0391002001"
    }
  ],
